	(text "GND = ESP32/USB side. EM_GND = isolated emitter battery side.\nEM_LED_RETURN is sunk to GND only while the power stage permits operation.\nMASTER_PERMIT therefore blocks all optical drive independently of the three GPIO commands.\nVerify startup/shutdown, PWM timing, low setting gate enhancement, current and temperature."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 257.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ef94ad89-ca14-5424-9752-137e156557f9")
	)
	(text "GPIO33 -> ESP_EMIT1 -> emitter1. GPIO25 -> emitter2. GPIO26 -> emitter3.\nAll outputs default off when control pins float. An asserted master permit alone does not pulse emitters.\nConnect each heater positive to EM_REG; connect its return ONLY to its EMITn_LOW net.\nDo not connect the switched heater return directly to EM_GND, which would bypass PWM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f023a928-4c7e-52ad-b5e0-39cf71a12d8a")
	)
